    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 1960's space race had many public missions, but some activities were classified at the highest levels. Researchers have reconfigured the events of one of the most well guarded and &quot;cosmic classified&quot; secrets of the Apollo program. You can now experience for yourself what happened in this Psychological Thriller / Walking Simulator. Take a trip to the moon alongside an unwelcome tour guide. Listen to his words and decide if you should follow him, or find a different path.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land on the moon's surface in the bounds of an unexplainable anomaly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras/c42e889ffa19ed395d1de934eebf908d.avif?t=1749923278\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how details from your past created the person you are now.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras/e1ca4852333ae0253f04b7736ce89ab4.avif?t=1749923278\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your way through an unknown labyrinth in a dark and foreign terrain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras/80303f38c12d918addcc10d0e1162a57.avif?t=1749923278\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 1960's space race had many public missions, but some activities were classified at the highest levels. Researchers have reconfigured the events of one of the most well guarded and &quot;cosmic classified&quot; secrets of the Apollo program. You can now experience for yourself what happened in this Psychological Thriller / Walking Simulator. Take a trip to the moon alongside an unwelcome tour guide. Listen to his words and decide if you should follow him, or find a different path.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land on the moon's surface in the bounds of an unexplainable anomaly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras/c42e889ffa19ed395d1de934eebf908d.avif?t=1749923278\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how details from your past created the person you are now.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras/e1ca4852333ae0253f04b7736ce89ab4.avif?t=1749923278\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your way through an unknown labyrinth in a dark and foreign terrain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653250/extras/80303f38c12d918addcc10d0e1162a57.avif?t=1749923278\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
